# Real credential values never get committed. Anything under k8s/secrets/
# is applied directly to the cluster with `kubectl apply -f` -- outside
# ArgoCD's watched paths (k8s/p0, p1, p2, p3, ...) -- so it's never part of
# a git diff or push in the first place. See k8s/secrets/README.md for what
# needs to exist and how to (re)create it.
k8s/secrets/*
!k8s/secrets/README.md

# Generic fallback patterns, in case a real secret ever gets written
# somewhere else by mistake.
*.secret.yaml
.env
.env.*
.venv
*.pem
*.key
